<p class="mut" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:1rem" id="speed-note">* <b>Spe</b> = actual in-battle Speed stat (not base stat), before stages, items, abilities or paralysis. Computed with the Gen 4 formula floor((floor((2×Base + IV + floor(EV/4)) × Level / 100) + 5) × Nature) using Kaizo base Speed from the docs, the listed level and nature, and 0 EVs. The docs don't state which IVs Kaizo trainers use, so the range runs from IV 0 to IV 31. Where the sheet lists two natures (e.g. tag partners, gender variants) or an unreadable nature, the range covers all of them (marked “nature?”).</p>
